IPlqPZl_lfQK0vA3vkA70kEOnj9P1ekFE0OofzOV--tBxas&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQfzlEfy61-GFXLsoVAfqwW3ITH89WYL0oC9Qt2fU8x2Q&oe=6B09CA26"}, {"file_name": "cove_h01_banking_past_the_conch.png", "id": "1778416013206442", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/604385997_1778416016539775_1727904890145178895_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ynAIwx2fKEEQ7kNvwEEx_xG&_nc_oc=Adra6c3wIqOG_J5W1aIKShzebbMEyQjlZdiCNr-1JL4RtldpCiYiUTFTQUYuQq4Uq5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSXAS89_zbXPtrencKIS3CrJDk8_BKACfSVe2e9YnwuIA&oe=6B09AF75"}, {"file_name": "forest_h15_crystal_caps.png", "id": "1089296313996585", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/673745728_1089296317329918_9061417716953586783_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h9wkceRTo7IQ7kNvwHbj6sY&_nc_oc=AdrT_S-0_A3jz5UHPUNlEArr66aTUmFZCV5VMiKWkKoKaEnOhqW_gzn-3FuiDG_3BLE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRs4pxmaXg6VeKlodDFTO3fOg0AM4NT8xsx6iiHE214bw&oe=6B09CABE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Moonrise Mini Golf", "keywords": ["minigolf", "putting", "golf", "multiplayer", "cozy"], "long_description": "Start at the Moonrise Clubhouse, a lantern-lit terrace over a twilight sea. A two-minute tutorial teaches the basics, then step through a portal onto one of two hand-crafted 18-hole courses.\n\nLANTERN COVE: Golden hour by the sea. Bank off a giant conch, putt along stilt-village boardwalks and through a glowing sea-glass grotto, send your ball down pipes and past a shipwreck, and finish under the lighthouse at the Lantern Heart.\n\nNEON SHROOM FOREST: Night in a hushed, bioluminescent forest under a huge moon. Roll through root tunnels and down a log flume, past chiming crystal caps and colossal glowing mushrooms, and climb the towering Mother Shroom for the finale.\n\nEXPLORE: Ten lost balls hide on each course, up the lighthouse stair, behind the falls and deep in the woods.\n\nREAL PUTTING: The ball is simulated 360 times a second, so soft taps stay precise and firm putts carry. Fit the blade putter to your grip, swing, and read every slope and bank. Your score lives on a watch on your wrist.\n\nPLAY TOGETHER: Host a private game and share a short join code. Up to four players play each hole together with voice chat. Mute, block or report anyone at any time.\n\nMOVE YOUR WAY: Teleport or walk, snap or smooth turn with a comfort vignette, or warp straight to your ball. One-controller play, left- or right-handed, colour-blind friendly ball styles and unscored practice. Every sound and every piece of art was made for this game.", "short_description": "Two hand-crafted 18-hole courses, a golden-hour seaside cove and a moonlit forest of glowing mushrooms, reached through portals in a cozy seaside clubhouse. Putt with real physics and a blade putter fitted to your hand, learn in a quick tutorial, keep score on your wrist watch, hunt for lost balls, and play with up to three friends online with voice chat. Teleport or walk, even with one controller. Free, with no in-app purchases."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://dreamscale123.github.io/moonrise-mini-golf-site/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://dreamscale123.github.io/moonrise-mini-golf-site/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Moonrise Studios", "support_website_url": "https://dreamscale123.github.io/moonrise-mini-golf-site/support.html", "website_url": "https://dreamscale123.github.io/moonrise-mini-golf-site/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "i